{{!
{
  "name": "Application Status Update",
  "subject": "Your Yconic VC Accelerator Application"
}
}}

<div
    style="font-family: 'SF Pro Display', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333333; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; background-color: #F8F8F8;"
>
    <div
        style="background-color: #FFFFFF; padding: 40px; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);"
    >
        <div
            style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 2px solid #FF4500;"
        >
            <div
                style="display: inline-block; background-color: #FFF1EC; color: #FF4500; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 16px; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;"
            >Yconic VC Accelerator</div>
            <h1
                style="color: #FF4500; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px;"
            >Thank You for Your Application</h1>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
            <p>Dear {{applicantName}},</p>

            <p>I'm Yolanda, Head of HR at Yconic VC Accelerator. I've personally
                reviewed your application and wanted to reach out directly.
                While we were genuinely impressed by your vision and potential,
                after careful consideration, we are unable to move forward with
                your application at this time.</p>

            <div
                style="background-color: #FFF1EC; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 24px 0; border-left: 4px solid #FF4500;"
            >
                <p><strong style="color: #FF4500;">Application Overview</strong></p>
                <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 16px 0;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Founder ID:
                        {{applicationId}}</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Review Date:
                        {{reviewDate}}</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            {{#if feedback}}
                <div
                    style="background: linear-gradient(145deg, #F8F8F8 0%, #FFF1EC 100%); padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 32px 0;"
                >
                    <h2
                        style="color: #FF4500; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0;"
                    >💡 Growth Opportunities</h2>
                    <p>As someone who's passionate about founder development,
                        I'd like to share some constructive insights:
                        {{feedback}}</p>
                </div>
            {{/if}}

            <div
                style="background-color: #FFF1EC; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 32px 0; border-left: 4px solid #FF4500;"
            >
                <h2 style="color: #FF4500; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0;">🌱
                    Stay Connected</h2>
                <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 16px 0;">
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Join our Founder Community
                        for networking and resources</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Access our Startup
                        Development Workshops</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Subscribe to our Monthly
                        Founder Insights Newsletter</li>
                    <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Consider applying again in
                        our next cohort (3 months)</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <a
                    href="#"
                    style="display: inline-block; background-color: #FF4500; color: white; padding: 16px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 24px; font-weight: 500; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255,69,0,0.2);"
                >Schedule Feedback Discussion →</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div
            style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666; font-size: 14px;"
        >
            <p>Wishing you continued success,<br />Yolanda<br />Head of HR,
                Yconic VC Accelerator</p>
            <p><small>I'm available for a personal discussion about your
                    application and growth opportunities.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>